    <mj-section
  background-color="#eff1f4"
  padding="1px 1px 1px 1px"
  border-radius="10px"
>
  <mj-column background-color="#fff" border-radius="10px" padding="0px">
    <mj-image
      border-radius="10px 10px 0 0"
      padding="0"
      width="600px"
      src="https://www.londonsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
      alt="REPLACE_ME"
      href="https://www.londonsummary.com/"
    />
    <mj-text
      padding="20px 20px 0px 20px"
      font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <h2
        style="
          font-size: 24px;
          line-height: 1.2;
          font-weight: 400;
          margin: 0;
        "
      >
        Art meets Earth
      </h2>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text
      padding="0px 20px 0px 20px"
      font-family="Arial"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 0px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  Somerset House hosts a three-day Earth Day Weekender, offering a lively mix of art, ideas, and interactive experiences focused on our relationship with the planet. Across talks, workshops, and immersive installations, visitors can explore themes that stretch from the depths of the ocean to the richness of the soil beneath us.
</p>
<p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 0px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  Highlights include a free drop-in screen-printing workshop with Jealous Print Studio, centered on sustainable making. Visitors can also join Dr. Masharu, founder of the Museum of Edible Earth, for a distinctive geophagy session that challenges people to think differently about the earth they inhabit.
</p>
      <p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-top: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  🔗 <strong>Link:</strong>
<a
  style="
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #80011f;
    color: black;
  "
  href="https://www.somersethouse.org.uk/whats-on/earth-day-2026"
  target="_blank"
>Earth Day Weekender</a><br />📅 <strong>When:</strong> April 16 to April 18<br />💸 <strong>Cost:</strong> Open entry<br />📍 <strong>Where:</strong>
<a
  style="
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #80011f;
    color: black;
  "
  href="https://www.somersethouse.org.uk/whats-on/earth-day-2026"
  target="_blank"
>Somerset House</a>
</p>
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>

